From 79edeb83154be1fbe7b5991eae4770154874a335 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:21:30 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: airoha: add AN7552 and AN7563 GPHY calibration

Add the A7552.04.02 initialization, impedance conversion and per-port
compensation data from the supplied tcetherphy_7552.c reference. Reuse
the common analog calibration machinery with the AN7552 voltage and
seven-bit R50 encoding, serialized across the four PHYs.

Support zero/five-ohm MDI resistors and integrated/discrete transformer
profiles through DT. The SDK checks PHYSID2 == 0x0400; scope that match
to AN7552/AN7563 machines rather than inventing the PHYSID1 value.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/phy/mediatek/airoha-ge-soc.c | 266 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 drivers/net/phy/mediatek/mtk-ge-soc.h    |   2 +
 2 files changed, 262 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/phy/mediatek/airoha-ge-soc.c b/drivers/net/phy/mediatek/airoha-ge-soc.c
--- a/drivers/net/phy/mediatek/airoha-ge-soc.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/mediatek/airoha-ge-soc.c
